WEBVTT

00:28:29.665 --> 00:28:35.418
like, ideas spark when you have this sort
of catalyst of a creative person here

00:28:35.442 --> 00:28:36.857
and an analytical person here

00:28:36.881 --> 00:28:38.920
and someone who knows
something else there,

00:28:38.944 --> 00:28:41.678
and they talk together
and kind of, bada boom!

00:28:41.702 --> 00:28:44.395
An idea erupts and everyone goes,
"Yes! That's great."

00:28:44.419 --> 00:28:48.147
There's definitely a case
for that type of openness

00:28:48.171 --> 00:28:53.182
and letting people have, you know,
yes, sometimes a bit of stress,

00:28:53.206 --> 00:28:58.982
but the energy and provocation
and so forth from each other.

00:28:59.006 --> 00:29:02.054
Do you see a best of both worlds
possibility here?